WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.440
Let the past die.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.040
That's the only way to become what you were meant to be.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.320
Darkness rises,

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.880
and light to meet it.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.420
I need someone

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.280
to show me my place in all this.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.520
Come on!

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.900
(chewbacca noises)

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.820
(porg noises)

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.720
Woo!

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.100
This is not going to go

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.960
the way you think.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:39.960
(lightsaber noise)

